menu "ColdGuard Leader ingress (external integration component)"

    config CG_LEADER_NETCMD
        bool "Enable the Leader canonical-command ingress reader"
        default y
        help
            Replaces the delivered console reader task with a Leader-owned
            reader that additionally accepts the "#CG CMD <record>" canonical
            envelope from the Leader gateway serial writer, validates it
            through the delivered Member A command contract unchanged, and
            emits the delivered "#CG CMDACK" evidence. All other lines keep
            the delivered console behavior. The delivered fail-closed gates
            stay exactly as shipped: no wall clock (commands blocked at
            EPOCH_UNSYNCHRONIZED), compiled-out output stage, unresolved
            limits. Fault-injection builds keep the delivered console
            regardless of this option.

endmenu
